      "id": "g2-d01",
      "phase": "architecture",
      "owner": "user",
      "question": "Approve selected architecture 0.1: browser-owned deterministic analysis and curated evidence, versioned static regional bundles, explicit device-local saves, and an optional stateless Sites AI wording gateway?",
      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "Approved Gate 2 architecture v0.1 exactly as documented in .autoforge/04-selected-architecture.md.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-06T02:09:42+00:00",
      "resolved_at": "2026-08-06T02:28:45+00:00",
